Asymmetric Mukaiyama Aldol Reactions
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Sedelmeier, Joerg; Hammerer, Tim; Bolm, Carsten
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Letters (2008), 10(5), 917-920

