$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General procedure for the asymmetric
Mukaiyama-Type Aldol Reaction: A flame-dried Schlenk tube under argon
atmosphere was charged with Cu(OTf)2 (0.025 mmol) and sulfoximine 4
(0.026 mmol). Then, dry toluene (1.5 mL) was added, and the resulting
