$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Mukaiyama aldol adduct 110. Aldehyde 11 (1.058 g, 2.504 mmol) was
coevaporated with benzene (2 x 20 mL), dried shortly under high vacuum,
dissolved in anhydrous CH2Cl2 (6.0 mL, 0.4 M) under N2, and cooled to 0
°C. MgBr2·OEt2 (2.175 g, 8.42 mmol, 3.4 equiv) was added and after 8 min,
enolsilane 109 (1.147 g, 4.75 mmol, 1.9 equiv) was added dropwise over 2
min. After 2 h 25 min at 0 °C, additional enolsilane 109 (229.1 mg, 0.95
mmol, 0.38 equiv.) was added dropwise and after additional 50 min, sat.
aq. NaHCO3 (50 mL) and Et2O (50 mL) were added. The layers were separated
and the aqueous phase was extracted with Et2O (2 x 50 mL). The combined
organic phase was washed with sat. aq. NaHCO3 (50 mL) followed by brine
(50 mL) and evaporated on celite. The crude mixture was purified by dry
column vacuum chromatography (0-30% EtOAc in hexanes) affording aldol
adduct 110 (1.377 g, 93%) and recovered ketone 12 (439.6 mg, 81%) as
colorless oils. 110: TLC R f = 0.26 (30% ethyl acetate/hexanes); [α]20 D
+18 (c 1.06, CH2Cl2); IR (neat) 3493, 2925, 2097, 1714, 1614, 1586, 1515
cm–1; 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.27 (d, 2H, J = 9 Hz, PMB), 6.88 (d, 2H,
J = 9 Hz, PMB), 4.68 (d, 1H, J = 12 Hz, ArCHa), 4.40 (d, 1H, J = 12 Hz,
ArCHb), 4.40–4.38 (m, 1H, C34H), 4.07 (dt, 1H, J = 2, 7 Hz, C32H), 3.80
(s, 3H, ArOCH3), 3.72 (d, 1H, J = 2 Hz, OH), 3.31 (t, 1H, J = 2 Hz,
C33H), 3.19 (dd, 1H, J = 12, 5.5 Hz, C40Ha), 3.07 (dd, 1H, J = 12, 6.5
Hz, C40Hb), 2.79 (dd, 1H, J J = 17, 7 Hz, C35Ha), 2.60–2.52 (m, 1H,
C37H), 2.50 (dd, 1H, J = 17, 6 Hz, C35Hb), 2.41 (dd, 1H, J = 16.5, 5.5
Hz, C29Ha), 2.25 (dd, 1H, J = 16.5, 8 Hz, C29Hb), 2.12 (s, 3H, C27H3),
2.10–2.04 (m, 1H, C30H), 1.73 (ddd, 1H, J = 13.5, 8, 6 Hz, C38Ha),
1.66–1.60 (m, 2H, C39H, C31Ha), 1.44 (ddd, 1H, J = 14, 8, 6 Hz, C31Hb),
1.07 (ddd, 1H, J = 14, 8, 6 Hz, C38Hb), 1.06 (d, 3H, J = 7 Hz, C46H3),
0.91 (d, 6H, J = 7 Hz, C45H3, C47H3), 0.89 (s, 9H, SiCMe3), 0.12 (s, 3H,
SiMe), 0.08 (s, 3H, SiMe); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 212.9 (C36), 207.9
(C28), 159.3 (C), 130.0 (C), 129.7 (CH), 113.8 (CH) (PMB), 79.8 (C33H),
72.2 (ArCH2), 72.2 (C32H), 66.9 (C34H), 57.5 (C40H2), 55.2 (ArOCH3), 51.1
(C29H2), 44.6 (C35H2), 44.1 (C37H), 41.4 (C31H2), 37.0 (C38H2), 31.3
(C39H), 30.3 (C27H3), 25.7 (SiCMe3), 25.6 (C30H), 20.3 (C45H3), 17.89
(C47H3), 17.86 (SiCMe3), 17.0 (C46H3), –4.4 (SiMe), –4.8 (SiMe); Exact
mass calcd for C31H54O6SiN3 [(M+H)+]: 592.3782; found: 592.3782 (ESI).
