and 99% respectively (determined by HPLC using chiral OJ-H column,
hexane/2-propanol = 9/1, λ = 254 nm, 30 °C, 0.7 mL/min, (syn) tmajor =
43.0 min, tminor = 44.6 min, (anti) t = 49.6 min, t = 57.6 min).
