$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 2) General Procedure for Vinylogous Mannich
Reactions Preparation of
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidin-1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one
(9b) An oven-dried, 10-mL flask containing a solution of 42.3 mg (0.20
mmol, 1.0 equiv) of (E)- N-benzylidene-4-methoxyaniline (1b) and 1.70 mg
(0.002 mmol, 0.01 equiv) of chiral phosphoric acid (4b) in 2.0 mL of a
freshly prepared solvent mixture (iPrOH, tBuOH, 2- Me- 2-BuOH 1:1:1 and
1.0 eq H2O) was cooled to - 30°C. After one minute 160 mg (0.60 mmol, 3.0
equiv.) (Z)-1-[1-(tert-Butyldimethylsilanyloxy)-1,3-butadienyl]piperidine
(5d) was added dropwise. The resulting mixture was stirred rapidly for 7
days whereupon the solvent was removed in vacuo. The residue was purified
by silica gel chromatography (diethyl ether/petroleum ether, 8/1) to
afford 72 mg (99%; 90% ee) of
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidine-
1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one (9b) as a colorless oil.
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidin-1-yl)pent-2-
en-1-one (9b), yield 91% [α]D24 = -9.6° (c = 1.04, CHCl3). 1H-NMR(400
MHz, CDCl3, 26°C): d = 1.53 (m, 4 H, H16, H17), 1.62 (m, 2 H, H16'), 2.72
(dd, J = 7.0, 7.0 Hz, 2 H, H4), 3.34 (m, 2 H, H15), 3.56 (m, 2 H, H15'),
3.68 (s, 3 H, H14), 4.41 (t, J = 7.0 Hz, 1 H, H5), 6.25 (d, J = 15.0 Hz,
1 H, H2), 6.50 (m, 2 H, H11), 6.67 (m, 2 H, H12), 6.72 (td, J = 7.0, 15.0
Hz, 1 H, H3), 7.22 (m, 1 H, H9), 7.28-7.35 (m, 4 H, H7, H8). 13C-NMR(75
MHz, CDCl3, 26°C): d = 24.51 (C17), 25.45 (C16), 26.58 (C16'), 41.36
(C4), 42.98 (C15), 46.82 (C15'), 55.61 (C14), 58.04 (C5), 114.6 (C11),
115.0 (C12), 123.8 (C2), 126.4 (C7), 127.1 (C9), 128.6 (C8), 140.3 (C3),
140.8 (C10), 142.8 (C6), 152.2 (C13), 164.9 (C1). IR (Film): ν (cm-1) =
3339, 2999, 2936, 2855, 1712, 1657, 1609, 1511, 1440, 1237, 1179, 1139,
1124, 1039, 976, 819, 787, 760, 701. UV (MeCN): λmax (lg (ε)) = 205
(4.522), 207 (4.526), 241 (4.368), 310 (3.534). HR-MS (ESI): calcd. for
C23H29N2O2 ([M+H]+): 365.22235; found: 365.22222. calcd. for C23H28N2O2Na
([M+Na]+): 387.20430; found: 387.20404. calcd. for C46H57N4O4 ([2M+H]+):
729.43743; found: 729.43728. calcd. for C46H56N4O4Na ([2M+Na]+):
751.41938; found: 751.41861. HPLC: Chiralcel OD column, solvent:
n-hexane/i-propanol 4/1, flow rate: 1.0 ml/min, UVdetection at 250 nm,
major enantiomer tr = 14.9 min (9b), minor enantiomer tr = 25.7 min
(ent-9b).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective, ee=90%, Mukaiyama-Mannich reaction, optimized on
catalyst loading, optimization study
